  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "6e123d7c-f068-46ca-a67b-24edb6a1b922",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 230,
        "content": "## Social · On-demand post generator\nA form takes a topic, a prompt or a link and a media brand. The workflow applies the brand's voice, keeps the link as the post's source, drafts a caption and an image with Gemini, checks them, and sends them to Telegram for approval. A rejection produces a new image.\n\n**Platforms:** Gemini, Telegram\n**Source and tests:** github.com/kimjoshuadr/n8n-workflows · `production/social-content`"
      }
    },
